#. Tag: para
#: man-dcop.1.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Inside &kde;, you can enter <userinput>help:/kdcop</userinput> "
"in &konqueror; to see the User Manual for <application>kdcop</application> "
"graphical dcop tool."
msgstr ""
"Dentro de &kde; pode introducir <userinput>help:/kdcop</userinput> "
"en &konqueror; para consultar o Manual do Usuario de <application>"
"kdcop</application>, a ferramenta gráfica de dcop."
